<description>&lt;p&gt;Cartel leader arrests have sparked riots and roadblocks in Matamoros after the leader's son was detained, disrupting traffic. A Mexican engineer was indicted for building a cross-border tunnel used by the CJNG cartel, while a man accused of constructing a similar tunnel was also charged with terrorism. In the United States, a man with alleged cartel ties shot at a U.S. marshal, and federal agents arrested multiple suspects linked to the Sinaloa Cartel in drug raids in Tennessee and a train cargo theft in California. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiRkFVX3lxTE1nZDQ2ZHJTRFZUS1M4Y3hweVpDdjhBMVpwRHZUNEsyTXpoTXpuMDNjam56cDBLemlXYUVoeEFnY3lJRGp3dUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;NEWS.am&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNLU84NHNNVzFEZ3FiTWhJenU2elgwaDlRQ0xZSnBJakpUeVJOR2xlZHRXbmpoZW1USDJNWHVLeDVrbzFlcGJEc1FvZFpiRjZFNXUyQWVZWmRPOHlMZ0NWemZ2YWFFcVltLUExdUNOVHNsR2Zpd2k4QXJrOHc3WDZyVEthTUgyQ1VCVTBQRUEwVlRvUlFybF9meWpGNHVzbkRjcGJFZklFRVYxOU5WRmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BNO News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTFBNaC1PWEJiQ0VFSC1xNXlnN2ZGZTFZMXNBMGpKWE1CSlZaTTRyUVdxWFpIOXAxSE15SThZRHh2LU1Yd0FQUjlLVnFZa3dBR2lCc0ZPZGZhMzR2MFU2a2Q0dzZja3RSaDVX?oc=5&quot;&gt;World Socialist Web Site&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NewsNation&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOa3dKWjdiNGFzQVBZM1FvbTkwZDE2UzcxMW9Pc1U4WjNqS1kySVpQZ3ZiNlBKakJ1eVI3d3BUR3JpMngwUFFYSXRUa2FDWGJyWFV3Z3FpNTVyR1pZSG9TQ2xOQW5Xbi1ZaG9IMWtiNDZVd3dpbkstOFl4c09zWUFvMzdRRmwwUHhtdXBUVlY2ZTA1UEwtYjNEYnVPNlVWcXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Courthouse News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NBC Los Angeles&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.